<h2 class="compendium-hr heading-anchor" id="Advanceto2ndLevel" data-content-chunk-id="8a763046-b656-4355-84b9-c9234354f54b"><a href="#Advanceto2ndLevel" data-content-chunk-id="c250ef4a-06b6-4bd1-8272-c3efc11b5246" aria-hidden="true"></a>Advance to 2nd Level!</h2>
<p data-content-chunk-id="52050247-6d47-494e-a227-7e1cf5088361">Each character advances to 2nd level at the end of the first Exams encounter.</p>
